msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingSchemeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "taggingScheme is functional"
msgstr "taggingScheme 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingSchemeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:taggingScheme is functional: a gmeow:Tagging act is performed within exactly one scheme — even though the applied tag may itself be cross-listed in several schemes via gmeow:tagInScheme, the act names a single scheme context. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:taggingScheme 是函数性的:一次 gmeow:Tagging 行为恰好在一个方案内进行——即便所应用的标签本身可能通过 gmeow:tagInScheme 被交叉列入多个方案,该行为也只指明一个方案语境。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingTagFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "taggingTag is functional"
msgstr "taggingTag 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingTagFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:taggingTag is functional: a gmeow:Tagging relator applies exactly one tag — several tags on a resource are several relators, not multiple values on one Tagging."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:taggingTag 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Tagging 关系体恰好应用一个标签——一项资源上的多个标签对应多个关系体,而非一个 Tagging 上的多个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingTaggedFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "taggingTagged is functional"
msgstr "taggingTagged 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingTaggedFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:taggingTagged is functional: each gmeow:Tagging relator applies to exactly one tagged resource, with a fresh relator minted per distinct tagging act. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:taggingTagged 具有函数性：每个 gmeow:Tagging 关系体恰好作用于一个被标记资源，每个不同的打标签行为具有新的关系体。该记录不是该术语的定义，也不是形状；义务由该记录推理得出，不在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingSchemeFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:taggingScheme names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:taggingScheme 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingSchemeFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingSchemeFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:taggingScheme, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:taggingScheme, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingSchemeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:taggingSchemeFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:taggingScheme ."
msgstr "gmeow:taggingSchemeFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:taggingScheme ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingTagFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:taggingTag names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:taggingTag 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

