msgid "gmeow:taggingTagFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:taggingTag ."
msgstr "gmeow:taggingTagFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:taggingTag ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/taggingTaggedFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:taggingTagged names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:taggingTagged 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

